# Daily Review Day59

## 오늘의 핵심 문법

### Pronouns

- 주격 → I / he / she / we / they
- 목적격 → me / him / her / us / them
- 소유격 → my / his / her / our / their + 명사
- 소유대명사 → mine / his / hers / ours / theirs
- 재귀대명사 → myself / himself / herself / ourselves / themselves

### 핵심 비교

- This is **my** laptop.
- This laptop is **mine**.

- The manager called **me**.
- **I** called the manager.

- She introduced **herself**.

